<mj-text>Hi <%= name %>,</mj-text>
<mj-text>Your administrator has created an account for you. Use this secure link to sign in and set your initial password. You must configure your password before accessing the application.</mj-text>
<mj-button href="<%= magicLink %>">Set up my account</mj-button>
<mj-divider />
<mj-text color="#626d80" font-size="13px">This link expires in 24 hours. If you were not expecting this invitation, contact your administrator.</mj-text>
<mj-text color="#626d80" font-size="12px" css-class="fallback">If the button does not work, copy this link into your browser:<br/><a href="<%= magicLink %>"><%= magicLink %></a></mj-text>
